see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاهِضَةٌ</span>]. (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ نَهّاضٌ بِبَزْلَآءَ</span>: see
